            <description>&lt;p&gt;There are several ways to do mesh morphing in Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;One way is to use a commercial plugins like &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.assetstore.unity3d.com/en/#!/content/3428&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;Megafier&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You can use a simple script to do mesh morphing as well: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/minhhh/unity-meshmorphing&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;https://github.com/minhhh/unity-meshmorphing&lt;/a&gt;. Remember to make all your mesh have the same number of vertices.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
